{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VortX is a casual arcade style game featuring a black hole, a space ship and asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple but challenging: Evade from the asteroids as long as you can while the singularity prevents you from actually escaping the scene. Collect and use your PowerUps wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts quite easy but it quickly gets harder over time. Can you survive more than 5 minutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level is procedurally generated. There is a seasonal ranked level (the level will always be the same during the season (four seasons per year) but differ between different seasons to keep the challenge interesting). Every season has an own leaderboard.<br>Further it has a randomized single- and multiplayer (two players) mode. Every randomized playthrough will differ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Content Warning: This game makes use of stroboscopic effects and quick scene changes, which is intended. Currently it is not possible to disable these. A future update may or may not offer the option to disable some of these effects.</i></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/995760?t=1762469004","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/995760?t=1762469004","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995760/ff792321cf231c3db749906011463bccfeae116a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1762469004","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995760/ff792321cf231c3db749906011463bccfeae116a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1762469004","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen PvP","id":37},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Stats","id":15},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >VortX is a casual arcade style game featuring a black hole, a space ship and asteroids.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The gameplay is simple but challenging: Evade from the asteroids as long as you can while the singularity prevents you from actually escaping the scene. Collect and use your PowerUps wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game starts quite easy but it quickly gets harder over time. Can you survive more than 5 minutes?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The level is procedurally generated. There is a seasonal ranked level (the level will always be the same during the season (four seasons per year) but differ between different seasons to keep the challenge interesting). Every season has an own leaderboard.<br>Further it has a randomized single- and multiplayer (two players) mode. Every randomized playthrough will differ.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Content Warning: This game makes use of stroboscopic effects and quick scene changes, which is intended. Currently it is not possible to disable these. A future update may or may not offer the option to disable some of these effects.</i></p>","developers":["Firesplash Entertainment"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/995760/2de556bf117100d8134a107de10a5591e5bd1e87/header.jpg?t=1762469004","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akama